1
00:00:03,208 --> 00:00:07,578
Open Settings, Artificial Intelligence, and find the Memory section.

2
00:00:08,038 --> 00:00:09,769
Pick the Index profile.

3
00:00:09,769 --> 00:00:14,248
This one index holds the memories of every user, so avoid changing it

4
00:00:14,248 --> 00:00:18,548
once people use memory, or the saved memories are no longer found.

5
00:00:19,077 --> 00:00:24,617
Default top N is how many saved memories the assistant gets back when it searches.

6
00:00:25,354 --> 00:00:32,157
Under General, Enable preemptive memory retrieval looks up a person's memories before the model answers.

7
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:36,054
Turn it off to keep the memory tools, but skip that step.

8
00:00:36,662 --> 00:00:41,064
Enable user memory turns memory on for chat interactions.

9
00:00:41,064 --> 00:00:42,252
Click Save.

